            "id": "action",
            "instance": "71aa9230-962e-4fe3-b530-5a119d8458e0",
            "properties": [
                [
                    "name",
                    "Spearphishing Attachment"
                ],
                [
                    "ttp",
                    [
                        [
                            "tactic",
                            "TA0001"
                        ],
                        [
                            "technique",
                            "T1566.001"
                        ]
                    ]
                ],
                [
                    "description",
                    "Sidewinder leverages targeted spearphishing emails containing malicious attachments to gain initial access to victim environments. These emails are typically tailored to specific organizations or individuals and often impersonate trusted entities such as government agencies, defense organizations, or business partners. The attachments may include weaponized documents or archives that execute malicious code when opened, enabling Sidewinder to establish an initial foothold, deploy additional malware, maintain persistence, and conduct espionage-focused activities within compromised networks."
                ],
