                            "TA0001"
                        ],
                        [
                            "technique",
                            "T1190"
                        ]
                    ]
                ],
                [
                    "description",
                    "Sidewinder leverages vulnerabilities in internet-exposed applications and services to gain initial access to victim environments. The group has been observed exploiting weaknesses in web applications, enterprise portals, and other publicly accessible systems to execute malicious code, deploy payloads, or obtain unauthorized access. Successful exploitation enables Sidewinder to establish a foothold within targeted networks, bypass authentication mechanisms, and conduct follow-on activities such as reconnaissance, credential theft, lateral movement, and data exfiltration in support of its espionage-focused operations."
                ],
